Z||000005||2xsess||10-04-2000||05:19 PM||||I like the machine gun trigger idea!! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>Actually I got lucky, the donor has decent door panels so I'll be using them too.<P>Thanks for all the advice!!!! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR><P>------------------<BR>Jeff<BR>85GT||||reg||12
